---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about The Art Deco, an editorial destination for considered interiors, modern home aesthetics, and curated finds." />
    <title>About Us | The Art Deco</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#FAF9F6] font-sans text-stone-800">
    <Header />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-[#5c534d]">Our point of view</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-[#121212] sm:text-5xl">About The Art Deco</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-stone-600">A considered approach to making a house feel more like your own.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-14 grid max-w-5xl gap-12 border-y border-[#e8e0d2] py-12 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-16 md:py-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#5c534d]">The Art Deco</p>
          <p class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl leading-snug text-[#121212]">Spaces with character. Details with purpose.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-600 sm:text-base">
          <p>The Art Deco is an editorial destination for interior design inspiration and the details that make a home feel considered. We bring together room ideas, approachable styling notes, and carefully curated home finds for people who value both beauty and everyday comfort.</p>
          <p>Our point of view balances modern living with timeless influence: thoughtful proportions, tactile materials, warm neutrals, and the occasional statement piece. The goal is not a perfect room, but a personal one that works beautifully in real life.</p>
          <p>From a collected living room to a quieter bedroom, our edits are here to help you discover a direction, explore useful pieces, and make design choices with confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[#121212] sm:text-3xl">“Good design is not about more. It is about choosing what belongs.”</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-stone-500">The Art Deco editorial philosophy</p>
      </aside>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
